--------------------+---------------+------------+-------------+--------------------+-----+--------------------------------------------+------------
 regress_rls_schema | part_document | pp1        | PERMISSIVE  | {public}           | ALL | (dlevel <= ( SELECT uaccount.seclv        +| 
                    |               |            |             |                    |     |    FROM uaccount                          +| 
                    |               |            |             |                    |     |   WHERE (uaccount.pguser = CURRENT_USER))) | 
 regress_rls_schema | part_document | pp1r       | RESTRICTIVE | {regress_rls_dave} | ALL | (cid < 55)                                 | 
(2 rows)

