                   QUERY PLAN                    
-------------------------------------------------
 Nested Loop
   CTE q
     ->  Seq Scan on z1
           Filter: (((a % 2) = 0) AND f_leak(b))
   ->  CTE Scan on q
   ->  Materialize
         ->  Seq Scan on z2
